WEBVTT

00:01.300 --> 00:02.730
What is this?!

00:03.130 --> 00:04.980
What is this heinous act?!

00:04.980 --> 00:08.480
A coup d'etat broke out at dawn
yesterday in the royal palace.

00:08.480 --> 00:11.840
Assassination attempts were made
against the Queen and the First Princess.

00:11.840 --> 00:13.370
Many injured.

00:14.060 --> 00:16.450
This barbaric act...

00:16.810 --> 00:18.790
...cannot be tolerated!

00:18.790 --> 00:21.340
Whatever the case may be,
it's the truth.

00:21.340 --> 00:25.380
The brigade of police is patrolling
in a province on the edge of the imperial palace.

00:25.900 --> 00:28.170
The entire country is on high alert.

00:28.820 --> 00:31.220
The royal palace is now
the most dangerous area.

00:31.710 --> 00:33.860
Do you still want to go there?

00:37.980 --> 00:40.830
What about the option of getting in
after the culprit is caught?

00:41.270 --> 00:44.230
That is an option.

00:44.710 --> 00:47.070
But they can't catch the culprit.

00:47.740 --> 00:50.740
Because the culprit is inside
the royal family?

00:51.390 --> 00:53.570
Could it be the Lord Mask?

00:53.570 --> 00:55.050
I don't know.

00:55.050 --> 00:59.790
But if they can find the culprit
when I return to the castle,

01:00.460 --> 01:03.880
I don't think it was
the Lord Mask who did it.

01:05.200 --> 01:06.420
You?

01:06.420 --> 01:09.220
Is that your Star Spirits Arts, Sisbell?

01:09.220 --> 01:12.760
Yes. I can imitate being a detective.

01:12.760 --> 01:17.390
I see. If you go back to the palace,
you can find the culprit.

01:17.390 --> 01:20.480
So the next target...

01:20.480 --> 01:24.360
...will be the detective, not the Queen.

01:24.360 --> 01:28.320
That's one more reason
for me to be targeted.

01:28.320 --> 01:31.360
You seem pretty calm about this.

01:31.360 --> 01:33.750
I trust you all.

01:33.750 --> 01:36.950
Please protect me until
the royal palace, okay?

01:38.490 --> 01:39.910
EPISODE 3: WITCH,
You've got to be kidding me!

01:39.910 --> 01:41.790
DANCE OF THE MOON, STARS AND SUN
A coup d'etat in the royal palace?!

01:41.790 --> 01:43.000
DANCE OF THE MOON, STARS AND SUN
Lady Aliceliese!

01:43.830 --> 01:46.080
We haven't sealed off the terminal, right?

01:46.080 --> 01:46.600
Yes!

01:46.600 --> 01:48.410
The number of services
has been cut down,

01:48.410 --> 01:51.150
but the express service
to the central province is still alive!

01:51.150 --> 01:52.220
Thank you.

01:54.470 --> 01:55.260
Rin.

01:56.090 --> 02:00.450
Lady Alice, arriving early
won't make the train come faster!

02:01.020 --> 02:03.440
So you mean we shouldn't be rushed?

02:03.440 --> 02:05.960
I'm sorry, but...

02:06.360 --> 02:11.320
Rin, I made the right choice, didn't I?

02:11.320 --> 02:16.780
Yes. It's ironic that Lady Alice
isn't in the castle with the Queen,

02:16.780 --> 02:20.750
but I thought Lady Sisbell would be
safe with that Imperial Swordsman.

02:21.310 --> 02:24.980
It's a bit frustrating to see her
with Iska, though.

02:26.410 --> 02:27.040
Well...

02:28.420 --> 02:30.880
We talked a lot alone.

02:30.880 --> 02:33.760
I was really close to him...

02:35.340 --> 02:36.380
Lady Alice?

02:36.380 --> 02:39.060
No! This is not what you think!
This is...!

02:41.250 --> 02:42.390
Alice.

02:42.390 --> 02:43.310
Mother?

02:44.530 --> 02:46.400
I'm so glad you are safe.

02:46.770 --> 02:49.130
They said there was a bomb
in the queen's chamber,

02:49.130 --> 02:50.980
and you were in danger.

02:50.980 --> 02:53.840
It's not a bomb,
but it's Star Spirits Arts.

02:53.840 --> 02:56.660
There was no trace of gunpowder.

02:56.660 --> 02:59.380
So there was a traitor in the castle...

02:59.380 --> 03:00.730
I agree.

03:01.200 --> 03:04.290
A bomb can be remotely triggered,

03:04.290 --> 03:06.880
but the range of Star Spirits Arts is limited.

03:07.350 --> 03:10.090
The culprit must have been
in the immediate vicinity.

03:10.090 --> 03:13.710
If so, Sisbell's power could
track down the culprit.

03:13.710 --> 03:16.800
Internal cleansing is always painful.

03:17.220 --> 03:20.760
Alice, do you still don't know
where Sisbell is?

03:21.900 --> 03:23.220
Not yet.

03:23.220 --> 03:25.010
We must hurry to find her.

03:25.470 --> 03:27.420
Please take care of her.

03:27.980 --> 03:29.230
Yes.

03:29.590 --> 03:31.670
Now, if you'll excuse me, Mother.

03:32.100 --> 03:33.340
Please be careful.

03:35.610 --> 03:39.690
I'm so sad. It's the first time
I've lied to my mother.

03:39.690 --> 03:41.660
You do it often.

03:41.660 --> 03:46.030
Like when you don't want to go to a book club
or when you have a headache and can't move.

03:46.030 --> 03:47.750
It's a method you use often.

03:47.750 --> 03:48.500
Rin.

03:48.500 --> 03:50.210
I slipped out of my mouth.

03:50.210 --> 03:52.750
You should keep up with Sisbell.

03:53.180 --> 03:55.880
Because I have to pretend
that I don't know anything.

03:56.320 --> 03:59.300
You never know when you
might be a target, Lady Alice.

03:59.660 --> 04:01.550
Please be careful.

04:01.550 --> 04:03.560
Good news, everyone.

04:03.560 --> 04:06.060
Shuvalts has arrived
in the central province.

04:06.060 --> 04:09.060
Tomorrow he should have
an audience with the Queen.

04:09.060 --> 04:12.440
We will also find
a safe way to the castle!

04:12.440 --> 04:15.190
You often said "should,"
which makes me worry.

04:15.190 --> 04:17.610
You are so mean.

04:17.980 --> 04:21.430
Don't get carried away.
Just keep assuming.

04:21.430 --> 04:24.370
What will you do if things go wrong?

04:24.370 --> 04:26.310
I know that...

04:29.840 --> 04:32.500
What are we going to do
with those patrollers?

04:32.500 --> 04:36.720
We need to be patient until Shuvalts
makes contact with the Queen.

04:38.630 --> 04:40.340
W-What is that?

04:40.340 --> 04:41.260
An explosion?!

04:42.180 --> 04:43.910
The same culprit, huh?

04:44.350 --> 04:46.640
Then we should chase them down!

04:46.640 --> 04:47.850
Y-You're going?

04:48.210 --> 04:51.340
No, I can track them well enough here.

04:56.070 --> 04:59.820
O stars, let me see your past.

05:09.190 --> 05:09.960
Found you.

05:20.070 --> 05:21.090
Sisbell!

05:21.630 --> 05:24.890
You ruffian! You must be
targeting me, aren't you?!

05:24.890 --> 05:26.540
Duck, Sisbell!

05:32.210 --> 05:35.310
Did it hit him? At that distance?

05:35.310 --> 05:38.990
Choose. Either your body is full
of holes or you're going down.

05:41.780 --> 05:42.820
Get crushed.

05:45.990 --> 05:47.780
Wind? No...

05:47.780 --> 05:49.280
It's gravity.

05:49.280 --> 05:52.250
It's a variant of the Wave Star Spirit
that manipulates waves!

06:05.570 --> 06:06.550
You...

06:06.550 --> 06:11.100
Aww, you cut off the protector on my neck.

06:11.510 --> 06:13.690
I can't use it anymore.

06:15.460 --> 06:19.060
For a hired soldier,
he's pretty good.

06:19.060 --> 06:22.240
Who is he exactly, Sisbell?

06:22.240 --> 06:24.990
You... Vichyssoise?!

06:24.990 --> 06:27.940
If they know that you're
trying to attack me,

06:27.940 --> 06:29.830
your position in the Hydra family will...

06:29.830 --> 06:31.080
They won't know.

06:31.080 --> 06:31.790
Huh?

06:33.680 --> 06:36.780
Everyone, you must stay away from her.

06:42.260 --> 06:45.380
Captain Mismis, get Sisbell out of here now!

06:45.730 --> 06:47.110
Iska?

06:47.110 --> 06:48.100
Why?!

06:48.530 --> 06:53.600
The monster you saw at the castle
looked like this, right?

06:54.470 --> 06:56.150
Beautiful, isn't it?

07:00.390 --> 07:03.440
It should be fine if you see me
in this form, right?

07:04.910 --> 07:08.870
We don't need the Lou family,
which has yet to defeat the Empire.

07:09.250 --> 07:13.420
Goodbye, Lou's blood vessel!

07:17.110 --> 07:18.500
He repel my fire?

07:19.330 --> 07:21.550
- I can't let you kill Sisbell!
- This way!

07:23.300 --> 07:28.670
Iska! You told me you are a swordsman
specializing in using star spirits!

07:28.670 --> 07:31.410
Don't lose! Iska!

07:33.120 --> 07:36.230
Yeah, I can't lose to a star spirit user.

07:36.730 --> 07:38.520
But...

07:38.880 --> 07:41.980
I've never faced such
an opponent as her before.

07:46.820 --> 07:49.820
Sisbell, who's that witch?!

07:50.210 --> 07:51.910
Yeah, who is she?!

07:52.420 --> 07:55.660
This is not like what you
explained to us, Ms. Employer.

07:56.290 --> 07:58.900
We promised to fight the assassins
of the Imperial Palace,

07:58.900 --> 08:01.750
but we didn't hear anything
about fighting a monster.

08:01.750 --> 08:03.190
That woman...

08:03.840 --> 08:08.940
Vichyssoise Alek Hydra is the daughter
adopted by the Hydra family.

08:09.520 --> 08:13.940
She was supposed to have been engaged
as an Inquisitor to judge criminals.

08:15.470 --> 08:16.350
But...

08:16.810 --> 08:19.230
You don't know that monster?

08:19.690 --> 08:23.860
If I knew, I wouldn't take the risk
of tracking her down.

08:25.550 --> 08:28.790
Well, whatever.
We'll get to the monster later.

08:33.530 --> 08:36.430
Hey, what are you doing?!

08:36.430 --> 08:39.370
I didn't ask you to carry me like this!

08:39.370 --> 08:41.210
Do you want to run by yourself?

08:42.400 --> 08:43.250
No...

08:44.100 --> 08:45.170
Hurry.

09:06.300 --> 09:07.870
Are you a human?

09:07.870 --> 09:12.010
I don't know. Can you give me
a definition of human?

09:15.120 --> 09:18.220
Sisbell called you Iska.

09:18.220 --> 09:19.750
Who are you?

09:19.750 --> 09:21.330
I'm her hired guard.

09:21.760 --> 09:25.940
That's not it. I'm asking if you are
the same person as the 11th seat

09:25.940 --> 09:30.770
of the Imperial Saint Disciples, the swordsman
known as the "Successor of Black Steel."

09:32.300 --> 09:36.340
Our bloodline Hydra has endured
a period of obscurity.

09:36.340 --> 09:38.850
We know what the imperial army is up to.

09:39.360 --> 09:41.520
So it's about country after all.

09:41.520 --> 09:42.830
You're a simpleton.

09:42.830 --> 09:46.560
I would never stop being a human
for such a trivial reason.

09:46.560 --> 09:48.940
Violet Belt!

09:48.940 --> 09:50.320
Two digits less.

09:50.320 --> 09:51.090
What?

09:51.090 --> 09:53.490
I said, two digits less!

09:55.920 --> 09:58.480
Cutting down my star spirit energy...

09:58.480 --> 10:01.210
What is that sword exactly?

10:01.210 --> 10:02.960
Who knows?

10:02.960 --> 10:07.250
Great Mother, Storm of Gravity!

10:07.880 --> 10:08.970
What?!

10:09.710 --> 10:11.950
Is Sisbell being targeted?

10:11.950 --> 10:14.890
But I'm sure Iska is with her.
Rin too.

10:15.230 --> 10:15.850
Lady Alice!

10:16.260 --> 10:17.580
Are you all right?

10:17.580 --> 10:19.220
Kisasage! Warvick!

10:19.600 --> 10:21.890
You two evacuated all the guests!

10:21.890 --> 10:24.100
I'll look for Sisbell!

10:24.100 --> 10:24.940
Roger!

10:26.250 --> 10:27.380
Lady Alice.

10:29.850 --> 10:31.890
We found Lady Sisbell.

10:31.890 --> 10:34.360
However, the security team
has been taken hostage,

10:34.360 --> 10:36.860
and Lady Sisbell has been wounded!

10:38.510 --> 10:39.450
Go on.

10:39.970 --> 10:41.950
I will show you the way, Lady Alice!

10:45.370 --> 10:46.560
Lady Alice?

10:48.300 --> 10:50.130
I wanted to ask you something.

10:50.130 --> 10:52.550
There is no time!
While we're doing this...

10:52.550 --> 10:54.930
Who are you?

11:00.930 --> 11:02.570
Got you.

11:12.950 --> 11:15.200
You're so good.

11:15.200 --> 11:18.280
It's good practice to crush
the Zoa and Lou families.

11:18.280 --> 11:22.140
I'll crush them
with my favorite technique!

11:22.140 --> 11:24.460
What's that sphere?

11:24.860 --> 11:26.940
Doesn't it reflect light?

11:27.380 --> 11:29.880
Could it be... Black hole?!

11:29.880 --> 11:33.490
Correct. But it's too late now.

11:34.880 --> 11:37.970
Magic Shot of Corpses.
Fire!

11:39.580 --> 11:45.370
Did you think that a princess like me wouldn't
remember every single soldier's face?

11:45.970 --> 11:47.930
Then you are mistaken.

11:49.470 --> 11:52.130
I never forget the face
and name of a single person

11:52.130 --> 11:54.150
who serves the Lou family.

11:55.490 --> 11:57.030
Sisbell is safe, right?

11:57.600 --> 12:00.180
If you have her,
you won't be obsessed with me.

12:02.270 --> 12:03.330
Get out of my way.

12:03.700 --> 12:05.040
They say it's good manners

12:05.430 --> 12:07.750
for a clown to leave quickly.

12:10.410 --> 12:14.050
You're a smart girl, Second Princess.

12:14.050 --> 12:16.800
And above all, you're so beautiful.

12:17.260 --> 12:18.390
Thank you.

12:18.390 --> 12:20.890
But I don't want compliments.

12:21.290 --> 12:23.310
I want you to move away.

12:23.890 --> 12:25.350
I beg your pardon.

12:25.350 --> 12:27.910
A gun? In this time?

12:27.910 --> 12:30.600
Farewell, Princess.

12:31.190 --> 12:32.020
That's...!

12:38.620 --> 12:41.340
There's no way I would dare
to challenge you head-on.

12:46.140 --> 12:47.410
My legs...!

12:49.030 --> 12:51.670
You tried to attempt a cruel act.

12:52.810 --> 12:54.210
Aliceliese!

12:56.820 --> 12:59.130
If the hotel collapses,
it'll be a disaster.

12:59.550 --> 13:02.450
I wonder how many people
would have died.

13:03.220 --> 13:05.300
She was defending that hotel
at that moment?!

13:13.730 --> 13:16.190
Oh, poor thing.

13:16.190 --> 13:18.780
I guess you didn't get crushed by that.

13:20.430 --> 13:23.580
I can't lose to a Star Spirit user.

13:23.580 --> 13:25.580
That is my intention.

13:25.580 --> 13:28.980
Then don't worry about losing.

13:28.980 --> 13:31.250
I'm not a Star Spirit user.

13:31.250 --> 13:33.840
Because I'm not from that dimension.

13:35.470 --> 13:37.920
That's not what I meant.

13:37.920 --> 13:40.590
I don't want to lose to you.

13:40.590 --> 13:43.130
That's what I meant!

13:45.110 --> 13:48.310
I understand that you are a monster.

13:48.710 --> 13:49.820
But...

13:50.690 --> 13:54.420
I don't feel any strength other than
the strength of the Star Spirit in you,

13:54.420 --> 13:58.150
who boasts that you are
not a Star Spirit user!

13:58.150 --> 13:59.070
What?

14:00.820 --> 14:03.030
Yes, you wouldn't understand.

14:04.960 --> 14:06.240
You just don't get it!

14:06.240 --> 14:11.290
You know what
the imperial army calls me, right?

14:12.840 --> 14:15.170
You can't imagine how much
it takes for a human girl

14:15.170 --> 14:17.970
to ridicule herself as a witch.

14:17.970 --> 14:23.180
You can't imagine how much
determination it takes.

14:24.690 --> 14:26.530
I don't want to lose.

14:26.530 --> 14:29.140
I don't want to lose to you,
who are just strong!

14:30.080 --> 14:31.430
Fire!

14:40.280 --> 14:40.940
What?!

14:40.940 --> 14:42.820
Vichyssoise!

14:42.820 --> 14:44.320
Begone!

14:46.160 --> 14:48.370
Now, Fire Star...

14:48.370 --> 14:50.190
Unleash!

14:51.020 --> 14:53.540
Ice Calamity Witch?!

14:56.330 --> 14:58.430
The black sword slashed the star spirits,

14:58.430 --> 15:00.340
and the white sword unleashed them!

15:03.970 --> 15:07.890
You... You'll have a real nightmare...

15:07.890 --> 15:11.030
Of a monster scarier than me...

15:11.030 --> 15:11.990
Rin!

15:11.990 --> 15:13.100
Shut up.

15:13.520 --> 15:14.420
Huh?

15:15.060 --> 15:16.470
What about me?!

15:16.470 --> 15:18.070
Tsk, so you're still alive.

15:18.540 --> 15:21.020
Even if you say something harsh like that...

15:21.760 --> 15:24.100
As far as I know,
Vichyssoise is a mere human

15:24.100 --> 15:27.070
who uses the star spirit of gravity.

15:28.070 --> 15:31.430
But I don't know what
the monster who fought you is...

15:31.940 --> 15:32.640
Rin!

15:32.640 --> 15:33.540
Lady Alice!

15:34.090 --> 15:37.370
Look at that! I restrained the assassin!

15:37.370 --> 15:39.100
This is my success!

15:39.100 --> 15:40.340
She's lying!

15:40.340 --> 15:43.280
Huh? Why are you here?

15:43.280 --> 15:44.630
Where's Sisbell?

15:44.630 --> 15:47.180
My friends are protecting her.

15:47.180 --> 15:48.750
You can count on them!

15:48.750 --> 15:51.090
W-Wait, Iska!

15:51.090 --> 15:53.100
Who does he mean?

15:53.100 --> 15:55.410
Huh? Vichyssoise?

15:55.410 --> 15:57.830
So who's behind the coup?

15:58.850 --> 16:02.440
Wait, Iska.
I've just realized something.

16:02.440 --> 16:03.780
Huh?

16:04.210 --> 16:06.490
Why is she naked?

16:06.490 --> 16:07.860
You curious about that?!

16:07.860 --> 16:10.300
B-Because if I really were naked,

16:10.300 --> 16:12.450
I'd be much better than her!

16:12.450 --> 16:14.540
W-Wait! What are you yapping about?!

16:14.540 --> 16:17.500
Lady Alice has lost her mind!

16:19.830 --> 16:21.290
Ice Calamity Witch, huh?

16:21.290 --> 16:23.230
Thank you, Jhin.

16:32.070 --> 16:36.110
Be careful, everyone!
This is so slippery!

16:36.110 --> 16:37.180
I'm sorry!

16:37.180 --> 16:40.770
Little girl, are your eyes glass balls?

16:40.770 --> 16:42.630
I'm sorry!

16:42.630 --> 16:46.150
I'll give you a discount coupon
for grilled meat as an apology!

16:46.880 --> 16:48.990
This is for an imperial restaurant.

16:48.990 --> 16:51.580
Boss, why are you blabbing all by yourself?

16:51.580 --> 16:52.570
H-Huh?

16:53.950 --> 16:56.500
Just like 30 years ago...

16:57.700 --> 17:03.330
Millavair, the real monster is about
to bite you in the throat.

17:05.790 --> 17:09.040
Back then, I didn't feel the cold.

17:09.790 --> 17:12.140
And I wasn't afraid of anything.

17:12.580 --> 17:13.620
Mira!

17:14.050 --> 17:16.350
You are not fit to be queen!

17:18.630 --> 17:20.560
Why? Salinger...

17:20.560 --> 17:25.190
Why did you come here to say that?!

17:25.690 --> 17:27.730
You're a fool.

17:27.730 --> 17:29.590
You can't be ruthless.

17:30.070 --> 17:31.680
And you can't be a witch.

17:33.200 --> 17:36.580
Let's not do this.
It's been 30 years.

17:37.750 --> 17:42.120
Now, as queen, I must just concentrate
on engaging the imperial army

17:42.120 --> 17:46.140
and Alice winning the queen's selection.

17:47.730 --> 17:50.840
I'm sorry, Elletear, Sisbell.

17:51.380 --> 17:54.250
I know very well
that you are very talented.

17:55.280 --> 17:58.400
But you both are not fit to be queens.

17:59.380 --> 18:01.590
A queen must be strong.

18:02.540 --> 18:06.360
The House of Lou will win
the next queen selection as well.

18:06.360 --> 18:07.830
On,

18:07.830 --> 18:10.320
it's pretty rare that you make a blunder.

18:10.320 --> 18:14.400
This mission is quite hard, Lord Growley.

18:16.580 --> 18:19.330
The Hydra family has
revealed its true nature.

18:19.980 --> 18:22.960
A faction that has been under the radar
for nearly a hundred years

18:22.960 --> 18:25.830
has come forward for queen selection.

18:26.250 --> 18:29.840
Is this a challenge for us?

18:29.840 --> 18:31.870
That's right.

18:31.870 --> 18:35.150
By pinning the charge
of the queen's assassination on me,

18:35.150 --> 18:37.180
the House of Zoa will be eliminated.

18:37.630 --> 18:39.810
You must be confident that we can win.

18:39.810 --> 18:42.710
We shall rise up in anger

18:42.710 --> 18:45.810
and retaliate with poise.

18:45.810 --> 18:48.150
The next queen selection,

18:48.150 --> 18:51.230
without a doubt,
will be the most fierce battle ever.

18:51.990 --> 18:53.220
Kissing.

18:54.400 --> 18:57.870
It's time to have that
eye patch of yours removed.

18:58.350 --> 18:59.700
Really?

18:59.700 --> 19:01.720
Yes, of course.

19:02.150 --> 19:04.620
You can use your power to the fullest.

19:05.100 --> 19:06.670
Let us purify the stars and the sun

19:07.230 --> 19:09.280
before we destroy the Empire.

19:09.710 --> 19:11.900
It's time for the moon to shine.

19:15.970 --> 19:18.260
For the next queen's selection,

19:18.650 --> 19:23.750
I guess the stars and the moon
are each confident of their own victory.

19:23.750 --> 19:25.640
Good morning, Elletear.

19:26.230 --> 19:29.250
Good morning, Lord Talisman.

19:29.250 --> 19:32.110
I'm honored to be invited here.

19:32.560 --> 19:33.990
You want tea?

19:33.990 --> 19:36.490
Then I would like a cup of white tea, please.

19:37.840 --> 19:40.620
I will prepare the best white tea.

19:40.620 --> 19:42.850
By the way, your little sister

19:42.850 --> 19:46.010
seems to have a very capable guard.

19:46.010 --> 19:50.460
It is a little painful that
he can take down Vichyssoise.

19:50.460 --> 19:52.470
A very capable guard?

19:52.470 --> 19:55.090
Iska... The former Saint Disciples, huh?

19:55.090 --> 19:55.880
Iska?

19:56.390 --> 20:00.730
Ah, I thought it would be wonderful
if I could have that guard.

20:00.730 --> 20:03.740
My mother and Alice
have strong star spirits.

20:03.740 --> 20:07.820
Sisbell is also blessed by having a good
star spirit and a strong guard.

20:08.730 --> 20:11.480
It's just me, who has nothing.

20:11.480 --> 20:14.280
Is it a rivalry as a big sister?

20:15.440 --> 20:18.320
That's just my way
of enjoying the human world.

20:18.320 --> 20:22.130
I want to live with envy,
anger, cravings,

20:22.130 --> 20:24.580
and any kind of passion in my heart.

20:25.120 --> 20:28.170
Isn't that what a witch
is supposed to do?

20:30.380 --> 20:32.060
We must go.

20:32.060 --> 20:33.790
Come on, wake up.

20:33.790 --> 20:39.750
I spent the whole night gathering
information about Vichyssoise...

20:39.750 --> 20:41.600
I didn't sleep a blink...

20:42.220 --> 20:44.470
Ah, the Imperial Swordsman!

20:44.470 --> 20:47.290
Where?!
Where is he?! Where is Iska?!

20:48.030 --> 20:49.530
It's a lie.

20:50.100 --> 20:53.400
Rin, I'm counting on you
to watch over Sisbell.

20:54.880 --> 20:57.970
I think that's the car
taking Vichyssoise away.

20:58.780 --> 20:59.970
Iska...

21:00.450 --> 21:03.240
Was Vichyssoise a strong opponent?

21:04.060 --> 21:06.580
The part that wasn't about
her strength was eerie.

21:06.960 --> 21:09.250
I don't know if it was
a feeling of discomfort.

21:09.250 --> 21:11.860
It was like, "Who do I fight with?"

21:12.540 --> 21:15.090
Maybe that was what you called fear?

21:15.530 --> 21:17.510
Maybe I'm still weak to be your guard.

21:18.930 --> 21:20.180
No...

21:20.790 --> 21:22.500
I have witnessed

21:22.500 --> 21:25.890
another monster before,
but not like Vichyssoise,

21:25.890 --> 21:28.550
and I no longer trust the royal family.

21:29.940 --> 21:33.270
It was more terrifying than Vichyssoise...

21:33.740 --> 21:34.810
What?

21:35.380 --> 21:38.100
I had a gut feeling the moment I saw it.

21:38.100 --> 21:40.140
It was not human,

21:40.140 --> 21:43.200
but something more vicious...!

21:45.330 --> 21:47.900
It's the same thing, Iska.

21:47.900 --> 21:51.370
I still can't stop shaking from the night

21:51.730 --> 21:54.670
I saw that jet-black monster...

21:54.670 --> 21:58.370
There must be a monster somewhere
that should be called a witch

21:58.370 --> 21:59.760
in the true sense of the word.

22:00.730 --> 22:03.020
I can't help but feel that way.

22:04.290 --> 22:08.210
You have come a long way,
relying on me, who belongs to the Empire.

22:08.950 --> 22:12.140
I think I finally understand why.

22:16.190 --> 22:17.200
Sisbell,

22:18.320 --> 22:20.900
I will definitely send you back
to the castle.
